    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1️⃣ Daily Fetch\n\n**Every Morning at 9** triggers the run, **Get Appointments** pulls the full appointment list from your sheet, **Filter For Tomorrow** narrows it to next day bookings, and **Filter Out Cancelled** drops anything marked Cancelled.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 1040,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9e61c659-3ae2-44cd-ac17-0f2a9f4f38aa",
      "name": "1️⃣ Daily Fetch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        960,
        176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2️⃣ Reminders & Exceptions\n\n**Has Valid Email** checks each appointment for contact info. **Send Reminder Email** and **Mark As Reminded** handle the normal case, while **Flag Missing Contact Info** and **Alert Front Desk Missing Info** make sure anyone without an email still gets a human follow-up instead of being silently skipped.",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "46c3a61c-6735-4e58-b680-19660969a48c",
      "name": "2️⃣ Reminders & Exceptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2032,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3️⃣ Same-Day Reminder\n\n**Two Hour Reminder Check** runs throughout the day, **Get Today Appointments** and **Filter Next Two Hours** find bookings starting soon, and **Send Final Reminder** gives patients a last-minute nudge.",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 1056,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ecaadc9d-6385-46fc-8d28-6c4c00b597b9",
      "name": "3️⃣ Same-Day Reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        960,
        960
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4️⃣ Summary & Error Handling\n\n**Build Summary** counts how many appointments were processed and **Front Desk Summary** posts the total to your staff channel. **Workflow Error Trigger** and **Alert Front Desk on Workflow Failure** catch and surface any failure in this workflow.",
        "height": 664,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "90af7276-ddeb-45f4-a72a-bd1ab205dc0a",
      "name": "4️⃣ Summary & Error Handling",
